.TH PAKU 1 2026-11-21 "paku 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
paku \- a small package-management wrapper around paru and pacman
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B paku
.I subcommand
.RI [ args ...]
.br
.B paku
.RB [ \-\-help | \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B paku
gives everyday package management on Arch Linux and its derivatives a smaller set of subcommands.
It uses
.BR paru (8)
when it is on the PATH, so the AUR is included; otherwise
.BR pacman (8),
with
.BR sudo (8)
for the operations that change the system (not when run as root), and the official repositories only.
Commands run directly, never through a shell, and
.B paku
exits with their exit code.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.BR upgrade ", " up
.B paru \-Syu
(or
.BR "sudo pacman \-Syu" ),
then
.B flatpak upgrade
if flatpak is installed. Exits with the first failure.
.TP
.BR maintain ", " cu ", " full ", " full\-upgrade " [" \fIargs\fR ...]
Runs
.B cachy\-update
(or
.BR arch\-update )
with the arguments.
.TP
.BR check ", " co
Lists pending updates:
.B cachy\-update \-\-list
or
.B arch\-update \-\-list
when installed, otherwise
.B paru \-Qu
(without paru,
.BR checkupdates ,
else
.BR "pacman \-Qu" ).
.TP
.BR update ", " refresh
.B paru \-Sy
(or
.BR "sudo pacman \-Sy" ).
.TP
.BR search ", " s " " \fIpkg\fR ...
.B paru \-Ss
(or
.BR "pacman \-Ss" ).
.TP
.BR install ", " add ", " i " " \fIpkg\fR ...
.B paru \-S
(or
.BR "sudo pacman \-S" ).
.TP
.BR remove ", " rm ", " uninstall " " \fIpkg\fR ...
.B paru \-Rns
(or
.BR "sudo pacman \-Rns" ).
.TP
.BR info " " \fIpkg\fR ...
.B paru \-Si
(or
.BR "pacman \-Si" ,
then
.B pacman \-Qi
if the package is not in the repositories).
.TP
.BR owns " " \fIfile\fR ...
.BR "pacman \-Qo" .
.TP
.BR files " " \fIpkg\fR ...
.BR "pacman \-Ql" .
.TP
.BR list ", " explicit
.BR "pacman \-Qe" .
.TP
.BR aur ", " aur\-list
.BR "pacman \-Qm" .
.TP
.BR aur\-audit ", " aur\-sec ", " aur\-security
Fetches the Arch Linux AUR compromised-package list with
.B curl
and checks the installed foreign packages against it.
.TP
.B clean
.B paru \-Sc
(or
.BR "sudo pacman \-Sc" ).
.TP
.BR autoremove ", " orphans
Removes the orphans
.RB ( "pacman \-Qdtq" )
with
.B \-Rns.
.TP
.BR completions " " bash | zsh | fish
Prints the completion script for the shell.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The exit code of the command run. 1 with no subcommand, an unknown one or a missing argument;
.B aur\-audit
exits 1 when an installed package is on the list or the list can't be fetched.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR paru (8),
.BR pacman (8),
.BR checkupdates (8)
